{"name":"The Forge Glass","slug":"glyph-forge-glass","blurb":"On the transform street, Tess carries the glass toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Forge. Click the glass and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Forge Glass.","seal":"3714f3683e0e3c0e98aa10be1e6dc2650f7ff345c08d461b9c4dd0daf5968870"}
